        <title type="html"><![CDATA[鋼琴選拔影片]]></title>
        <id>https://aa10200809-svg.github.io/blog/my-blog-9/19</id>
        <link href="https://aa10200809-svg.github.io/blog/my-blog-9/19"/>
        <updated>2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[鋼琴選拔影片]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>之前有提到，我要<a class="" href="https://aa10200809-svg.github.io/blog/my-blog-8/24">參加鋼琴大師班</a>，這幾天在學校錄了幾個版本，後來選了兩部</p>
<p>請大家聽聽看</p>
<p><strong>第一版</strong></p>
<iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yUV4GMYme_8" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen=""></iframe>
<br>
<p><strong>第二版</strong></p>
<iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wLRXzqvUloE" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen=""></iframe>
<p>這首叫做 <strong>李斯特 超技練習曲 No.10</strong></p>
